  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the following molecules,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/48228a9b-47a6-4b30-a923-dbbb9b3df511-image.png\" style=\"width: 236px; height: 116px;\" /></p><p>Hybridisation of carbon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> respectively&nbsp;are :</p>",
    "image": null
